<title>USA: Met-Coil Systems Corp Q3 Feb 28 oper net.</title>
<headline>Met-Coil Systems Corp Q3 Feb 28 oper net.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $ 0.02   profit	$ 0.01</p>
<p> Oper net profit		59   profit	    16</p>
<p> Revs			  8,700		    9,200</p>
<p>			NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $ 0.06     loss	$ 0.53</p>
<p> Oper net profit	     212     loss	 1,500</p>
<p> Revs			 26,400		   25,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 operating net excludes one-time non cash adjustment of certain costs, development and patent costs of $485,000, bad debt of $150,000, and liquidation of a investment in Met-Coil Europe of $500,000.</p>
<p>1997 nine months operating profit excludes items listed above and excludes first quarter lawsuit proceeds of $450,000.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 operating net excludes opertions of Rowe Machinery which was sold in February 1996.</p>
